// M5-A3P-1014. Ending E5 "Nothing comes" (C, 1.5 min). GOODBYE: HER VOICE. act3_ending.md §2 E5.
// On the dark, floating Kite, Asha tries to sing, properly, for the first time since the Letting. She draws breath and
// NOTHING COMES. Rhen doesn't comfort her with words; he sits beside her. sea_glow held at its last 0.06: the last of the
// risen dead leaving the water; the sea nearly dark, BUT NOT YET (its first full dark is E6's). `silence`: the quietest
// scene in the game. No line.
title: ending_nothing_comes
location: ch18/kite
---
@letterbox on
@camera E10
@music silence fade=0.0
@anim asha draw_breath
@wait 4.0
@anim asha open_mouth
@wait 5.0
@mark rhen by_asha walk
@anim rhen sit by_asha
@wait 8.0
@vfx glimmer_lift at=sea_last count=3 motion=spiral_up rate=slow
@wait 6.0
@fade out 3.0
@letterbox off
===
